{"games":[{"id":1117315411,"name":"Adventure Story!","desc":"A multiplayer, turn-based action-adventure game set in a cartoony world full of interesting and charming characters. You travel the world to learn powerful abilities in order to conquer the most evil beings with the help of your friends, while collecting treasures and valuable relics along the way.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\n2026 changes:\n- Fixed lots of issues, optimized some things, slight battle improvements\n- Reset dungeon ratings and fixed generation issues with it\n- Increased card drop rates from 1 in 8 to 1 in 2\n- Increased corrupted enemy rates when at max level\n- Fixed fleeing, made some battle camera movements faster\n- Dungeon difficulty is now total of player ratings instead of combined average\n- Dungeon rating on victory is no longer split between each player\n- Endless dungeons now scale faster based on number of players","path":"/game/1117315411-adventure-story","slug":"1117315411-adventure-story","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3582b88df1cfc42930d03145000dafa31426258ba15dafcd022c65fdb35d25cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e138e69056e4ab25dcef8c5694e5f643/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":12984391,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-16T05:07:32.817Z","creator":{"name":"vetexgames","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":625364452,"name":"Foam FPS","desc":"PREMIUM BENIFITS: 1.5X Cash and XP boost in-game! \n\nFoam FPS is a foam flinging first person shooter where you tag your friends and foes in an ultimate foam flinging experience! You'll be able to customize between 40+ different guns and play on multiple maps and game modes! \n\nVersion 6.21\n8/12/2024 changelog:\n- Brought back character customizer\n- Store now has a PolicyService check, this means the game will be playable in stricter countries\n- Optimized bullet lag and trails\n- Fixed mobile jump button\n- Re-added FFA and Gun Game score UI\n- Adjusted blue v orange score UI \n\nI'm working at another roblox game studio, I was dev on the Jaws: Infested Waters experience, so this is still a side thing that I'm not going to update for very much longer.","path":"/game/625364452-foam-fps","slug":"625364452-foam-fps","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/47f82258c63447d9b06656a39379794f488d9bd48760c94b7fe1c375b3220cad.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-560fc888332b9b97b758687202518193/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":50510258,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-08T15:09:23.576Z","creator":{"name":"IsaacThePooper","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1948498904,"name":"Legends of the Aether: Amnisica [2]","desc":"","path":"/game/1948498904-legends-of-the-aether-amnisica","slug":"1948498904-legends-of-the-aether-amnisica","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9a59d4173ab885fbf7ad061b8e67d1c37a8622bd185e96dac866e9070a200501.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ce31540016159d653ead2a56ebfd4dd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1955331402,"name":"Elemental Dragons Tycoon","desc":"","path":"/game/1955331402-elemental-dragons-tycoon","slug":"1955331402-elemental-dragons-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b924941fdc2141b20b9bc116e8c1a3f800eae2aaa491209351383c924ce0ae85.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3012459a5d480a338ccab9e5e77dee5f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2121759402,"name":"🔫 Gun Troll Tower 🔫 ","desc":"","path":"/game/2121759402-gun-troll-tower","slug":"2121759402-gun-troll-tower","thumbnail":{"url